# Data and generated artifacts are never committed (AGENTS.md §10).
# The leading "/" anchors these to the repo root. Without it, "data/" would
# also ignore the source package src/hmrec/data/.
#
# "/data/?*" and not "/data/": git never looks inside an ignored FOLDER, so a file in it
# could not be let back in. The contents are ignored one by one instead, and the small
# DVC pointer files (*.dvc: path, size and md5 of the data they stand for; docs/mlops.md
# §7.1) are let back in. The data themselves stay untracked, as before.
#
# "?*" (at least one character) and not "*": for git the two are the same. DVC reads
# this file with its own matcher, which takes "data/" itself as ignored by "/data/*" and
# then never looks for pointer files inside (found on 2026-11-22: `dvc status` and
# `dvc pull` saw no tracked data). "/data/?*" does not match "data/".
/data/?*
!/data/*.dvc
/artifacts/?*
!/artifacts/features/
/artifacts/features/?*
!/artifacts/features/*.dvc

# DVC: the local configuration holds the URL of the remote (the bucket name), which must
# not be in a public repository; the cache holds the data. .dvc/.gitignore lists them
# too; they are repeated here so that this file alone shows what is never committed.
/.dvc/config.local
/.dvc/cache/
/.dvc/tmp/

# results/ IS committed (small summary tables), so it is not listed here.

# Python environment and caches
.venv/
# The second environment, for DVC and MLflow only (Makefile, "M11 versioning"). They are
# kept out of .venv so that lint, tests and every run use exactly the packages of stage 1.
.venv-tools/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets and credentials: never committed
.env
.env.*
kaggle.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Kaggle submission files and model / array / table files, wherever they are.
# Competition data and anything derived from it row by row must not be committed.
# (results/*.csv are small summary tables and ARE committed, so *.csv is not listed;
#  .dvc/ is not listed either: its config has to be committable.)
submission*.csv
submission*.csv.gz
*.pt
*.pth
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
*.parquet

# Experiment trackers
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
wandb/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
